# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# DocuMind AI — Root Environment Variables
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# This file documents ALL environment variables across the stack.
# For per-service configuration, see:
#   backend/.env.example   — Backend (FastAPI)
#   frontend/.env.example  — Frontend (Next.js)
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values for Docker Compose usage.

# ── Frontend ──────────────────────────
# Development: http://localhost:8000
# Production:  https://your-api.onrender.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=DocuMind AI
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ── Backend ───────────────────────────
# FastAPI
BACKEND_HOST=0.0.0.0
BACKEND_PORT=8000
ENVIRONMENT=development
SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-here-must-be-at-least-32-characters
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=30

# Cookie Configuration
COOKIE_SECURE=False
COOKIE_SAMESITE=lax
# COOKIE_DOMAIN=

# ── Database ──────────────────────────
# Local PostgreSQL (Docker Compose)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://documind:your-password-here@db:5432/documind_ai
POSTGRES_USER=documind
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your-password-here
POSTGRES_DB=documind_ai

# Neon PostgreSQL (Production)
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@ep-xxx.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/documind_ai?sslmode=require

# ── AI / LLM ─────────────────────────
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3:8b

# ── Vector Store ──────────────────────
# pgvector connection uses DATABASE_URL
EMBEDDING_MODEL=BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS=384
CHUNK_SIZE=1000
CHUNK_OVERLAP=200

# ── Storage ───────────────────────────
UPLOAD_DIR=./uploads
MAX_FILE_SIZE_MB=50
# CHROMA_DB_PATH=./chroma

# ── Google OAuth ──────────────────────
# Get credentials from https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret

# ── Deployment Tokens (CI/CD only) ───
# These are NOT needed for local development.
# VERCEL_TOKEN=your-vercel-token
# RENDER_API_KEY=your-render-api-key
